# Container Apps Environment
CONTAINER_APP_ENV=exam-generator-env

# ========================================
# SECRETS (Stored in Azure Key Vault)
# ========================================
# These secrets are stored in Key Vault: exam-gen-kv-cj
# 
# - ACR-USERNAME
# - ACR-PASSWORD
# - DATABASE-URL (full connection string)
# - REDIS-HOST
# - REDIS-PASSWORD
# - STORAGE-ACCOUNT-NAME
# - STORAGE-ACCOUNT-KEY
# - APPINSIGHTS-CONNECTION-STRING
#
# ========================================
# MANUAL CONFIGURATION NEEDED
# ========================================
# You need to manually configure in Azure Portal:
# 
# 1. Container Apps - Environment Variables
#    - AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY (from your existing resource)
#    - AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://examgen-openai-cj-9351.cognitiveservices.azure.com/
#    - AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=gpt-4o
#    - AZURE_OPENAI_EMBEDDING_DEPLOYMENT=text-embedding-3-small
#    - JWT_SECRET (generate with: openssl rand -base64 32)
#
# 2. GitHub Secrets (for CI/CD)
#    - AZURE_CREDENTIALS (service principal JSON)
#    - ACR_USERNAME=examgeneratorcj
#    - ACR_PASSWORD (from Key Vault)
#    - All other secrets from Key Vault
#
# See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md for detailed instructions
